# Acceptance additions for tests/unit/test_research_local_plus_web.py
# Use real AthenaApplication + ExternalAccessGateway/SourceCaptureService public persistence path.
# Required assertions:
# 1. Create one local durable Source before enqueue.
# 2. Create authorization A and capture external Source A before enqueue.
# 3. Create authorization B and capture external Source B before enqueue.
# 4. enqueue_local_plus_web(... authorization A, captured_source_ids=(A,)); initialize/freeze.
# 5. Frozen candidates contain exactly {local Source, external Source A}; external Source B is absent.
# 6. Persist an additional Source after enqueue/pinned snapshot; it is absent after freeze.
# 7. Tamper-free mismatch case: enqueue scope with an explicit captured UUID not linked to authorization A via the public durable job/research boundary and assert ResearchSnapshotError before a CandidateSet is frozen.
# 8. Existing local_exhaustive and historical_backfill focused regressions remain green.
# 9. No network request occurs during freeze; all Web Sources must already exist durably.

